    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Start Accepting Crypto Payments in 2 minutes.</p>\n<p>0.1% Flat Fee and no KYC.</p>\n<p>Binance Pay payments go directly to your Binance account (no merchant account required).</p>\n<p>For On Chain payments (Arbitrum, Base, Ethereum, etc.), choose between Custodial and Non Custodial mode.</p>\n<p><strong>Custodial</strong>: we hold the funds for you.<br />\n<strong>Non Custodial</strong>: funds go directly to your own wallet.<br />\n<a href=\"https://pay.zenobank.io/demo\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Checkout demo</a></p>\n<p>Questions? Check the <a href=\"https://zenobank.io/#faqs\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">FAQs</a><br />\n<a href=\"https://zenobank.io/support\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">24/7 Support:</a></p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Install via the <strong>WordPress Plugin Installer</strong> or upload manually.  </li>\n<li>Activate the plugin under <strong>Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Installed Plugins</strong>.  </li>\n<li>Go to <a href=\"https://dashboard.zenobank.io/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">dashboard.zenobank.io</a> and create your account.  </li>\n<li>Add a wallet address or connect your <strong>Binance Pay API</strong> (this is where you will receive funds).  </li>\n<li>In your dashboard, go to <strong>Integrations <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> WooCommerce</strong>, and click <strong>Connect</strong>.  </li>\n<li>Copy the generated <strong>API key</strong>.  </li>\n<li>In your WordPress store, open the <strong>Zeno Crypto Payment Gateway</strong> settings and paste the API key.  </li>\n<li>Save changes, enable the gateway, and start accepting crypto payments.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.12</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated readme</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Lowest fees. USDT &amp; USDC Payments. Supports Binance Pay and popular wallets like MetaMask, Phantom, Trust Wallet, etc...",
